---
# Titled to match otel-collector/base so it replaces that block: this variant
# runs the collector in the default namespace rather than observability.
title: OpenTelemetry Collector
endpoints:
  - name: OTLP gRPC
    url: localhost:30317
  - name: OTLP HTTP
    url: http://localhost:30318
---
The collector runs in the `default` namespace, so its in-cluster address is
`otel-collector:4317` and received telemetry is printed via the debug exporter:

  kubectl logs -f deploy/otel-collector

Send a test trace:

  curl -X POST http://localhost:30318/v1/traces \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -d '{"resourceSpans":[]}'
